<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ref No</font><font face="arial">: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><i><font size="2">-If delay within QF control use:-</font></i></b></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">We regret the unexpected expense you incurred while delayed overnight and would be happy to look at this cost for you, up to a total of AU$200 per room for accommodation and AU$50 per person for meals, transfers or incidentals.&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><i><font size="2">-If cancellation or delay due to weather or air traffic control use:-</font></i></b></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="2">We regret that your flight was delayed overnight due to weather/air traffic control problems.&nbsp; As these disruptions were outside Qantas’ control, we are unable to reimburse you for the cost of accommodation and meals.&nbsp; Your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations.&nbsp; Refer to your insurer to see if you are able to make a claim.&nbsp; We are happy to assist with providing additional information, if required, about the &lt;cancellation/delay&gt; of your flight if wish to make an insurance claim.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="2">Again, we would like to apologise for this disruption and any inconvenience it has caused.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">I have attached a form for you to provide your bank account details, so that we can process any reimbursement. When returning the completed form and any supporting documentation, please reply to this email to ensure your information is attached to your current file for processing.</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>